Package: monctl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, ddcutil
Recommends: python3-pyqt6, python3-dbus, python3-gi
Description: Monitor control: profiles, per-game profiles, tray app
 Profiles across all monitors, applied automatically while a game runs,
 on a schedule or from global keyboard shortcuts. Brightness, contrast and
 input over DDC/CI for any monitor, and MSI on-screen settings (game mode,
 Night Vision, crosshair...) over USB through msigd. Includes a settings
 window, a tray icon and a command line tool.
